{"title":"Career roadmap · Curriculum Assistant","role":"Curriculum Assistant","summary":"A Curriculum Assistant supports curriculum development teams by researching educational content, organising curriculum materials, mapping learning outcomes, reviewing resources, preparing lesson frameworks and assisting with curriculum implementation and evaluation.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Curriculum Assistant supports curriculum development teams by researching educational content, organising curriculum materials, mapping learning outcomes, reviewing resources, preparing lesson frameworks and assisting with curriculum implementation and evaluation."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Education provides a strong foundation in learning theories, pedagogy, educational psychology, assessment, curriculum studies and teaching-learning processes. To become highly employable in curriculum roles, this should be combined with instructional design, learning outcomes, assessment design, educational technology, content development, data analysis and AI-assisted education workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Education","Curriculum & Instruction Skills","Instructional Design Portfolio","Education Internship","Curriculum Assistant","Curriculum Specialist","Curriculum Designer/Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Curriculum Intern, Education Content Intern"},{"text":"Research and content support"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Curriculum Assistant, Academic Content Associate"},{"text":"Curriculum documentation"}],[{"text":"Early-Mid"},{"text":"Curriculum Associate, Instructional Design Associate"},{"text":"Curriculum development"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Curriculum Specialist, Instructional Designer"},{"text":"Curriculum ownership"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Senior Curriculum Specialist, Learning Designer"},{"text":"Programme and learning design"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Curriculum Lead, Academic Program Manager"},{"text":"Curriculum strategy"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Curriculum, Academic Director"},{"text":"Organisation-wide curriculum"}],[{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Assessment Designer, Learning Experience Designer"},{"text":"Specialised learning design"}],[{"text":"Independent"},{"text":"Curriculum Consultant, Education Consultant"},{"text":"Advisory and curriculum projects"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BA Education","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Foundations of Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Core knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Philosophy of education"},{"text":"Sociology of education"},{"text":"Psychology of education"},{"text":"History of education"},{"text":"Educational foundations"},{"text":"Child and adolescent development"},{"text":"Learning theories"},{"text":"Teaching-learning processes"},{"text":"Inclusive education"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand how curriculum works"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the relationship between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Goals"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Outcomes"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum"},{"type":"h","text":"Units/Topics"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Activities"},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop communication skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Lesson observation"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Content editing"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Analysis Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a school/college curriculum and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning objectives"},{"text":"Subject structure"},{"text":"Progression"},{"text":"Learning activities"},{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Skills developed"},{"text":"Gaps and redundancies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Curriculum Development & Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where curriculum-specific skills should become stronger."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn curriculum concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum theory"},{"text":"Curriculum design"},{"text":"Curriculum development"},{"text":"Instructional objectives"},{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Competency-based education"},{"text":"Student-centred learning"},{"text":"Experiential learning"},{"text":"Project-based learning"},{"text":"Differentiated instruction"},{"text":"Inclusive curriculum"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learning taxonomies"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bloom's Taxonomy"},{"text":"Cognitive levels"},{"text":"Knowledge/skill development"},{"text":"Learning progression"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to convert:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Students understand climate change\""},{"type":"p","text":"into measurable outcomes such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Students can explain two major causes of climate change and interpret a basic climate-data chart.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Content development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson planning"},{"text":"Unit planning"},{"text":"Teacher guides"},{"text":"Student worksheets"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Rubrics"},{"text":"Educational resources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-2 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Unit Design Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create one complete unit containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Topics"},{"text":"Lesson sequence"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Teaching resources"},{"text":"Assessments"},{"text":"Rubrics"},{"text":"Differentiation strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Instructional Design & Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Mo