ation"},{"text":"AI literacy"},{"text":"Responsible AI in education"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are supplementary; a portfolio demonstrating complete curriculum units and assessment systems is more valuable."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Intern"},{"text":"Curriculum Assistant"},{"text":"Academic Content Associate"},{"text":"Education Content Associate"},{"text":"Content Development Assistant"},{"text":"Learning Content Associate"},{"text":"Instructional Design Intern"},{"text":"Assessment Content Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Early career"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Associate"},{"text":"Curriculum Developer"},{"text":"Instructional Design Associate"},{"text":"Learning Designer"},{"text":"Academic Program Associate"},{"text":"Assessment Associate"},{"text":"Education Program Associate"},{"text":"E-Learning Content Developer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Specialist"},{"text":"Instructional Designer"},{"text":"Learning Experience Designer"},{"text":"Assessment Designer"},{"text":"Learning Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Academic Program Specialist"},{"text":"EdTech Curriculum Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Senior"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Curriculum Specialist"},{"text":"Curriculum Lead"},{"text":"Instructional Design Lead"},{"text":"Academic Program Manager"},{"text":"Head of Curriculum"},{"text":"Academic Director"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum design"},{"type":"note","label":"Question","text":"How would you design a curriculum for a new subject?"},{"type":"p","text":"Expected approach:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify learner needs"},{"text":"Define competencies"},{"text":"Establish learning outcomes"},{"text":"Sequence content"},{"text":"Design learning activities"},{"text":"Develop assessments"},{"text":"Map outcomes to assessments"},{"text":"Pilot the curriculum"},{"text":"Collect feedback"},{"text":"Revise"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learning outcomes"},{"type":"p","text":"What makes a good learning outcome?"},{"type":"p","text":"It should be:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear"},{"text":"Measurable"},{"text":"Learner-centred"},{"text":"Appropriate to the learner level"},{"text":"Aligned with assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"If the learning objective is \"analyse\", why is a simple recall MCQ insufficient as the only assessment?"},{"type":"p","text":"Because the assessment should provide evidence of the analysis skill, not merely memory of information."},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Employers may ask how to determine whether a curriculum is effective."},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Student performance"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Teacher feedback"},{"text":"Assessment results"},{"text":"Learner progression"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Stakeholder feedback"},{"text":"Post-implementation outcomes"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"MA Education"},{"type":"p","text":"The most direct option for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum studies"},{"text":"Education research"},{"text":"Pedagogy"},{"text":"Education policy"},{"text":"Academic development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.Ed."},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly relevant for deeper professional study in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum"},{"text":"Teacher education"},{"text":"Educational leadership"},{"text":"Assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility depends on the programme and the student's prior qualifications."},{"type":"h","text":"MA/PG in Educational Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Digital learn